OL,3,GNEWSAThree charged after drugs worth
OL,4,Aalmost #115,000 seized
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men and a woman have been arrested
OL,7,Fand charged after police seized drugs
OL,8,Fworth almost #115,000 in Bellshill.
OL,10,FOfficers recovered the drugs -
OL,11,Fdescribed as large quantities of
OL,12,Fcocaine - at two properties on Babylon
OL,13,FRoad and Liberty Road on Friday as part
OL,14,Fof an intelligence-led operation.
OL,16,FCash was also found at the address on
OL,17,FLiberty Road.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
