OL,3,GNEWSAThree charged after drugs worth
OL,4,Aalmost #115,000 seized
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men aged 34 and 59 and a
OL,7,F34-year-old woman were arrested and
OL,8,Fcharged in connection with drug
OL,9,Foffences and are due to appear at
OL,10,FHamilton Sheriff Court on Monday.
